{
  "schemaVersion": "1.0",
  "source": "Apache Commons FileUpload 1.5 类级基准(31 类)",
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "DefaultFileItem.getString",
      "requirement": "无参 GetString 返回条目内容的字符串：优先使用内容类型中的 charset 参数解码字节；无 charset 参数时回退到默认字符集（默认 ISO-8859-1，可经 SetDefaultCharset 配置）；charset 无法识别时回退平台默认编码。",
      "source": {
        "language": "Java",
        "file": "fixtures/target-system/commons-fileupload-java-skeleton/src/main/java/org/apache/commons/fileupload/DefaultFileItem.java",
        "className": "DefaultFileItem",
        "method": "getString"
      },
      "target": {
        "language": "C#",
        "file": "fixtures/code-corpus/commons-fileupload-csharp/src/Commons/FileUpload/Compatibility.cs",
        "className": "DefaultFileItem",
        "method": "GetString",
        "isStatic": false,
        "constructorArgs": [
          {
            "type": "string",
            "value": "upload"
          },
          {
            "type": "string",
            "value": "text/plain"
          },
          {
            "type": "boolean",
            "value": false
          },
          {
            "type": "string",
            "value": "report.bin"
          },
          {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 10240
          },
          {
            "type": "null",
            "value": null
          }
        ]
      },
      "requirementDiffs": [
        "检索代码的 getString() 依赖 get() 读取内容，而骨架中 get() 是未实现桩（调用即抛 UnsupportedOperationException），因此 getString() 无法返回内容；需求要求真实返回按字符集解码后的字符串。"
      ],
      "notes": "Java DefaultFileItem 继承 DiskFileItem.getString()；C# 侧 DefaultFileItem 同样继承 DiskFileItem.GetString()。字符集回退链（charset 参数 → 默认字符集 → 平台默认）两者一致。"
    },
    {
      "id": "DefaultFileItem.isInMemory",
      "requirement": "IsInMemory 反映内容存储位置：条目从未写入或内容仍在内存时返回 true；写入内容超过阈值、溢写临时磁盘文件后返回 false。",
      "source": {
        "language": "Java",
        "file": "fixtures/target-system/commons-fileupload-java-skeleton/src/main/java/org/apache/commons/fileupload/DefaultFileItem.java",
        "className": "DefaultFileItem",
        "method": "isInMemory"
      },
      "target": {
        "language": "C#",
        "file": "fixtures/code-corpus/commons-fileupload-csharp/src/Commons/FileUpload/Compatibility.cs",
        "className": "DefaultFileItem",
        "method": "IsInMemory",
        "isStatic": false,
        "constructorArgs": [
          {
            "type": "string",
            "value": "upload"
          },
          {
            "type": "string",
            "value": "text/plain"
          },
          {
            "type": "boolean",
            "value": false
          },
          {
            "type": "string",
            "value": "report.bin"
          },
          {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 10240
          },
          {
            "type": "null",
            "value": null
          }
        ]
      },
      "requirementDiffs": [
        "从未写入任何内容时，检索代码的 dfos 字段未初始化，isInMemory() 访问 dfos.isInMemory() 抛 NullPointerException（延迟创建的历史缺陷）；需求要求全新条目返回 true（内容天然在内存）。"
      ],
      "notes": "C# 侧 IsInMemory() = cachedContent != null || storage.IsInMemory，存储流在构造时即创建。"
    },
    {
      "id": "DefaultFileItemFactory.createItem",
      "requirement": "CreateItem 按工厂配置（sizeThreshold 阈值、repository 存储目录、defaultCharset 默认字符集）创建 DefaultFileItem；创建出的条目无参 GetString 解码应遵循工厂默认字符集。",
      "source": {
        "language": "Java",
        "file": "fixtures/target-system/commons-fileupload-java-skeleton/src/main/java/org/apache/commons/fileupload/DefaultFileItemFactory.java",
        "className": "DefaultFileItemFactory",
